    "b-st-readers": {
      "id": "b-st-readers",
      "type": "structured-table",
      "props": {
        "columns": [
          "Consumer",
          "Form",
          "Where"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Worker boot",
            "The <decomp_standards> prompt block: accepted, worker-facing standards with their do and do_not signals; condensed to five rules at the compact budget and two at minimal",
            "worker/context.ts"
          ],
          [
            "Ship gate",
            "Enforced, not injected: review_lint findings carry the violated standard_id; the scan fails closed",
            "validation/qa/scan-diff.ts, validation/jobs/qa-gate.ts"
          ],
          [
            "Librarians",
            "Recognition only: id, title, summary of accepted standards, so a standard-mandated code shape is not mistaken for a developer convention",
            "librarianStandardsView in backfill/runner.ts"
          ],
          [
            "Operator",
            "GET /api/standards returns records, examples, the effective XML, context, inventory, and warnings; POST applies one validated edit",
            "api/routes/knowledge.ts"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "children": []
